# 第11章 图算法 - 最短路径
## 11.1 Dijkstra算法
```java
class Dijkstra {    public int[] dijkstra(GraphAdjList graph, int start) {        int n = graph.adj.size();        int[] dist = new int[n];        Arrays.fill(dist, Integer.MAX_VALUE);        dist[start] = 0;        PriorityQueue<Node> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Comparator.comparingInt(n -> n.dist));        pq.offer(new Node(start, 0));        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {            Node cur = pq.poll();            if (cur.dist > dist[cur.v]) continue;            for (int neighbor : graph.adj.getOrDefault(cur.v, new ArrayList<>())) {                int newDist = cur.dist + 1;                if (newDist < dist[neighbor]) {                    dist[neighbor] = newDist;                    pq.issue(new Node(neighbor, newDist));                }            }        }        return dist;    }    // 加权图    public int[] dijkstraWeighted(GraphAdjMatrix graph, int start) {        int n = graph.n;        int[] dist = new int[n];        boolean[] visited = new boolean[n];        Arrays.fill(dist, Integer.MAX_VALUE);        dist[start] = 0;        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {            int u = -1;            for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {                if (!visited[j] && (u == -1 || dist[j] < dist[u])) u = j;            }            if (dist[u] == Integer.MAX_VALUE) break;            visited[u] = true;            for (int v = 0; v < n; v++) {                if (graph.matrix[u][v] > 0 && !visited[v]) {                    dist[v] = Math.min(dist[v], dist[u] + graph.matrix[u][v]);                }            }        }        return dist;    }    static class Node { int v, dist; Node(int v, int dist) { this.v = v; this.dist = dist; } }}```## 11.2 Bellman-Ford算法```java
class BellmanFord {    public int[] bellmanFord(GraphAdjList graph, int start, int[][] edges) {        int n = graph.adj.size();        int[] dist = new int[n];        Arrays.fill(dist, Integer.MAX_VALUE);        dist[start] = 0;        // 最多n-1次迭代        for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {            boolean updated = false;            for (int[] e : edges) {                int u = e[0], v = e[1], w = e[2];                if (dist[u] != Integer.MAX_VALUE && dist[u] + w < dist[v]) {                    dist[v] = dist[u] + w;                    updated = true;                }            }            if (!updated) break;        }        // 检测负环        for (int[] e : edges) {            int u = e[0], v = e[1], w = e[2];            if (dist[u] != Integer.MAX_VALUE && dist[u] + w < dist[v]) {                // 存在负环            }        }        return dist;    }}```## 11.3 SPFA算法```java
class SPFA {    public int[] spfa(GraphAdjList graph, int start, int[][] edges) {        int n = graph.adj.size();        int[] dist = new int[n];        int[] inQueue = new int[n];        Arrays.fill(dist, Integer.MAX_VALUE);        dist[start] = 0;        Queue<Integer> q = new LinkedList<>();        q.offer(start); inQueue[start] = 1;        while (!q.isEmpty()) {            int u = q.poll();            inQueue[u] = 0;            for (int[] e : edges) {                if (e[0] == u && dist[u] != Integer.MAX_VALUE) {                    int v = e[1], w = e[2];                    if (dist[u] + w < dist[v]) {                        dist[v] = dist[u] + w;                        if (inQueue[v] == 0) {                            q.offer(v); inQueue[v] = 1;                        }                    }                }            }        }        return dist;    }}```## 11.4 Floyd-Warshall算法```java
class FloydWarshall {    public int[][] floyd(GraphAdjMatrix graph) {        int n = graph.n;        int[][] dist = new int[n][n];        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {            Arrays.fill(dist[i], Integer.MAX_VALUE);            dist[i][i] = 0;        }        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)            for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)                if (graph.matrix[i][j] > 0) dist[i][j] = graph.matrix[i][j];        for (int k = 0; k < n; k++)            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)                for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)                    if (dist[i][k] != Integer.MAX_VALUE && dist[k][j] != Integer.MAX_VALUE)                        dist[i][j] = Math.min(dist[i][j], dist[i][k] + dist[k][j]);        return dist;    }}```## 11.5 本章小结- Dijkstra：非负权图单源最短路，O((V+E)logV)- Bellman-Ford：任意权图，可检测负环，O(VE)- SPFA：Bellman-Ford队列优化，平均更快- Floyd：多源最短路，O(V³)